// The defined object names need to be tested later. If you always want to name your object after the file name,
// then the following definition is needed:
// Files.ObjectName = field(field.r(Files.Path,"/",0),".",0)


// 3. Setup Tests: For every input table, one test has to be performed.
// See setup rules for tests below:

// Please add tests between the comment rows  `[ START OF TESTS ]` and `[ END OF TESTS ]`
// you need to create 1 test block (`[ NEXT TEST ]`) for every input table group to be tested
// a group is defined as one or more tables which have the same data structure.
// groups must have the same object name (defined in generic setup).

// adapt all inputs marked as __[INPUT DESCRIPTION]__

